          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siku hiyo, kutatokea chemchemi ya kuwatakasa dhambi na unajisi wazawa wa Daudi na wakazi wote wa Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, nasema mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, majina ya vinyago vya miungu nchini nitayaondoa, wala hayatakumbukwa tena. Na wanaojidai kuwa manabii nitawaondolea mbali pamoja na tamaa zao za kuabudu sanamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu yeyote akijidai kuwa nabii, baba na mama yake waliomzaa watamwambia, ‘Unapaswa kufa kwa kuwa unasema uongo kwa jina la Mwenyezi-Mungu’. Na haohao wazazi wake watamchoma kisu akiwa anatabiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hiyo, kila nabii atayaonea aibu maono yake anapotabiri. Hawatavaa mavazi ya manyoya ili kudanganya watu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bali kila mmoja atasema, ‘Mimi si nabii. Mimi ni mkulima tu; nimeimiliki ardhi tangu ujana wangu’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mtu akimwuliza mmoja wao, ‘Vidonda hivi ulivyo navyo mgongoni vimetoka wapi?’ Yeye atajibu, ‘Vidonda hivi nilivipata katika nyumba ya rafiki zangu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
